    "title": "A Heart at Peace",
    "enTitle": "A Heart at Peace",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "はっ、はっ、はっ！\n……まだよ、私は、まだ……いける――っ！",
            "enText": "Haa, haa, haa! \n……Not yet, I can……keep going――!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 211,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（力が、入りすぎている――）",
                    "enText": "(She's putting in too much power――)",
                    "nextBlock": 2
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 42,
                    "pathId": 5966983210285360703
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -7223208382617410582
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7455811792256449924,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "かなり追い込んでいるのだろう。気力で脚を押し出すようにして、\nフォームが崩れかけているように見えた。",
            "enText": "She's really pushing herself. Her form was starting to crumble and it \nseemed like her legs were pushing forward on sheer willpower alone.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 110,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（やっぱり、今、彼女に必要なのは……）",
                    "enText": "(What she really needs right now is……)",
                    "nextBlock": 3
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 130,
                    "pathId": -1891055491791726984
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8526116683451790263,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "あら！　また見てくれてたのね♪　なにかアドバイスはある？\nもう一本走るつもりだから、そのあとでも――",
            "enText": "Oh! So you came to see me again♪ Do you have any advice? \nI plan on running one more, so after that is fine too――",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 265,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "君は……休むべきだ。頑張りすぎだよ！",
                    "enText": "You……should rest. You're working too hard!",
                    "nextBlock": 4
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "貴方は……休むべきだ。頑張りすぎだよ！",
                    "enText": "You……should rest. You're working too hard!",
                    "nextBlock": 4
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 176,
                    "pathId": 7328376907469164649
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 25,
                    "pathId": -2535124495504884762
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8341346714472154043,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "！　アハッ……あなたってば、もしかして忘れん坊さん？\nこの前も言ったけれど……いいわ、何度でも教えてあげる。",
            "enText": "! Ahaa……you're quite the forgetful trainer, aren't you? I said it \nbefore, but……it's fine, I'll tell you as many times as it takes.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 368,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 484,
                    "pathId": -8329202832101526996
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -2673906331315310539
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4204558933416650332,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "私はね、前に進み続けなきゃいけないの。脚を回して、頭を回して、\n誰にも追い越せないスピードで……前に、前に――前に！",
            "enText": "I have to keep moving forward. Keep moving, keep thinking, at a \nspeed where nobody can keep up……forward, forward――ever forward!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 470,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "――クイーンになるために",
                    "enText": "――To become Queen.",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 316,
                    "pathId": -2785266741077942084
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 138,
                    "pathId": 6092573026839131925
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 654720144093234289,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "……そう。よかった、ちゃんと覚えてくれてたのね。",
            "enText": "……Right. Good, you remembered.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 197,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": 5474645638565882531
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 45,
                    "pathId": 34795565107471907
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6246689762384289027,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "そういうことだから、悪いけどトレーニングに戻るわ！",
            "enText": "And that's why, sorry, but I'm going back to training!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 119,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "なら……なおさら羽を休めるべきだ",
                    "enText": "Then……all the more reason to rest your wings",
                    "nextBlock": 8
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "なら……なおさら羽を休めるべきだよ",
                    "enText": "Then……all the more reason to rest your wings",
                    "nextBlock": 8
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 138,
                    "pathId": -4291398038025736049
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -7218099704647856123
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1101788659042007010,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "...Huh?",
            "enText": "…Huh?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 26,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "羽を休めてこそ、より高く飛ぶことができる",
                    "enText": "By resting your wings, you can fly higher",
                    "nextBlock": 9
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 138,
                    "pathId": -6808563884163920236
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3763071277316562064,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "心のゆとりが、最高のパフォーマンスを生む。\n目指すべき場所へたどり着くための、足がかりになるのだ。",
            "enText": "A calm mind is the key to peak performance. It serves \nas a foundation to help you climb towards your goal.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 108,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "これを、君に渡そうと思って",
                    "enText": "I wanted to give you this",
                    "nextBlock": 10
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "これを、貴方に渡そうと思って",
                    "enText": "I wanted to give you this",
                    "nextBlock": 10
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 168,
                    "pathId": 8807162468601441611
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7236140662801193892,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "差し入れかしら？　心がこもっていれば、\nどんなものでもwelcomeだけどね！",
            "enText": "Is this a gift? If it's given with Heart, \nthen it's very welcome, whatever it might be!",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 197,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 219,
                    "pathId": 8687756832352245589
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 98,
                    "pathId": -4076289213754744605
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7927891894635237571,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "……って――",
            "enText": "……Wait――",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 62,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": -8145992351814784573
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 100,
                    "pathId": 3694845166152872566
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5889144679078632537,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "それ、爬虫類カフェの優待券じゃない……！\nいえ、確かに好きだけれど……大好きだけどっ！",
            "enText": "That's a coupon for a reptile cafe, isn't it……!? \nNo, well, I like it……rather I love it!",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 270,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "このお店、扱ってる爬虫類の数も多いんだ",
                    "enText": "And they have a wide variety of reptiles",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "このお店、扱ってる爬虫類の数も多いの",
                    "enText": "And they have a wide variety of reptiles",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 271,
                    "pathId": 2540896331090366386
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 94,
                    "pathId": -5313460851388835347
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1522617820271504548,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Wait, wait, wait a second!\nちょっと待って……！",
            "enText": "Wait, wait, wait a second! \nJust hold on……!",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 124,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "穴場だから1匹1匹とじっくり過ごせるって",
                    "enText": "You can really get to know them",
                    "nextBlock": 14
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -136351739503241809
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 59,
                    "pathId": -1292600375135759041
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 627396533732502036,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "調べ上げてきた情報で、猛プッシュする――！",
            "enText": "Using the information I researched \nthoroughly, I decided to push harder――!",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 72,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "珍しい爬虫類とも、触れ合えるらしい！",
                    "enText": "They even have some rare species!",
                    "nextBlock": 15
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 129,
                    "pathId": 8398447980668126206
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 93,
                    "pathId": -7541111723271187481
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6520804267976930390,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Urgh…………――",
            "enText": "Urgh…………――",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 92,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 81,
                    "pathId": -7159517731064858067
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 174,
                    "pathId": -3635780475132180534
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8614544304289766985,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Oh my……わかった、わかったわ。降参よ！",
            "enText": "Oh my……I got it, I got it. I give up!",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 199,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 108,
                    "pathId": 4875794333818503457
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -8373009305374649785
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4428582757455321149,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "行きましょう、今すぐに。\nYou're stuck with me now!　当然、あなたも一緒にね！",
            "enText": "Let's go, right now. \nYou're stuck with me now! Of course, you're coming with me!",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 246,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 99,
                    "pathId": 5499747150353777993
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 34,
                    "pathId": 7576294306105479876
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 925620340349176812,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "デアリングハートが、休息を受け入れてくれた。\nあの必死な提案に意味があったのだと、喜びを噛みしめる。",
            "enText": "And so, Daring Heart took a break. \nI was glad that my desperate proposal was accepted.",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 110,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "そんなに好きだったんだな、爬虫類",
                    "enText": "So you really like reptiles, huh?",
                    "nextBlock": 19
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "そんなに好きだったんだね、爬虫類",
                    "enText": "So you really like reptiles, huh?",
                    "nextBlock": 19
                }
