            "pathId": 7946344027844531822,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "……少し違うわ。……私、『爬虫類が好きだ』ってこと、\n古い雑誌のインタビューでしか言ってないの。",
            "enText": "……That's not quite right……『I like reptiles』, \nI've only ever mentioned it once in an old magazine interview.",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 280,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 166,
                    "pathId": 3353862537053240785
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 42,
                    "pathId": 3443839943025000592
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6797072357253275563,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "まさか、あんな小さな記事を見つけてくるなんてね……。\nフフ……あなたのその熱意に、負けたのよ！",
            "enText": "To think you'd find that small article…… \nFufu……I just lost to your passion!",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 317,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 158,
                    "pathId": 2965988817611307020
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 165,
                    "pathId": 728141219392204706
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3807672352744208833,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Wow...!　Amazing!",
            "enText": "Wow……! Amazing!",
            "nextBlock": 22,
