            "pathId": -8893382167033485649,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "見て、このグリーンイグアナの鱗のツヤ……！\nまるで宝石じゃない……！　So cool...!",
            "enText": "Look at this Green Iguana's scales, they're so shiny……! \nAlmost like they're jewels……! So cool……!",
            "nextBlock": 23,
