        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "ほら、このボールパイソン、すっごく大人しいわよ？\n肌触りもひんやりしてて……Good boy……！　最っ高だわ……！",
            "enText": "And this Ball Python, is really calm isn't it? \nIt feels nice and cool to the touch……Good boy……! This is the best……!",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 373,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 230,
