                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7062767466963947560,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "その様子を見守っていると、\nふと、ピタリと止まって動かないヤモリが目に留まった。",
            "enText": "As I watched over her, a gecko caught my eye. \nIt was remaining completely still.",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 97,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（寝てるのか……？）",
